# Build of the lean/ project from source, run on 24 October 2026 by Claude Opus 5.5 (used with Claude Code).
# Lean 4.19.0 (commit 6caaee842e94); Mathlib c44e0c8ee63ca166450922a373c7409c5d26b00b and its pinned dependencies.
# Mathlib was compiled from source (its prebuilt cache was not used). Commands: 'lake build' then 'lake build Entries'.
# While Mathlib was compiling, the comment-only edits made in this repository (author name, review notes, file paths)
# were copied into the build tree, so the project modules were compiled from exactly the sources in this repository.
# The consistency run at the end rebuilt the few modules affected, and 'lake build --no-build' then confirmed that
# every module is up to date with these sources.
# An earlier run, stopped by a missing ProofWidgets release file, had already compiled part of Mathlib; this log is
# the run that completed the build, so those modules are not listed again here.

